# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is blocked by .gitignore and must never be committed.
# IMPORTANT: this static site cannot read .env in the browser. These values are for any
# server, build step or backend you add later (booking API, RTO integration, email service).
# Anything shipped to the browser (including the WhatsApp number) is public.

# RTO_API_URL=
# RTO_API_KEY=
# DATABASE_URL=
# SMTP_PASSWORD=
